<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-2fd95b0 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent" data-id="2fd95b0" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container" data-settings="{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}">
<div class="e-con-inner">
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-6823a88f e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child" data-id="6823a88f" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container">
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-b4aadeb elementor-widget__width-auto elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="b4aadeb" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
SAP Payroll								</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-20d02d6f elementor-widget__width-initial elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading" data-id="20d02d6f" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="heading.default">
<h3 class="elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default">¿Qué es SAP Nómina?</h3>				</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-52ca29a5 elementor-widget__width-initial elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="52ca29a5" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
<p>SAP Nómina, también conocida como <strong>SAP SuccessFactors Payroll​</strong>, es una plataforma global de gestión de nómina en la nube. Permite a las organizaciones administrar el pago de sus empleados de manera precisa y puntual.</p>								</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-1ff9a019 elementor-widget__width-initial elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="1ff9a019" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
<p>Es un <strong><a href="/blog/software-para-nomina/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">software de nómina</a></strong> preconfigurado con las normativas fiscales de más de <strong>48 países, para simplificar las operaciones de nómina global</strong> desde un solo sistema. Reduce riesgos mediante un enfoque de <strong>revisión de nómina continua</strong> para detectar errores y envíar notificaciones al equipo responsable.</p>								</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-23e410f8 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child" data-id="23e410f8" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container" data-settings="{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}">
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-c37df5b elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading" data-id="c37df5b" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="heading.default">
<p class="elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default">Potenciado con IA</p>				</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-4630afd7 elementor-widget__width-initial elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="4630afd7" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
<p>Con el uso de la IA en tu sistema de nómina, <strong>automatiza cálculos, garantiza el cumplimiento normativo</strong> y acelera procesos repetitivos. Además puedes tomar decisiones basadas en <strong>datos en tiempo real. </strong></p>								</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-1708ee5f e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child" data-id="1708ee5f" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container">
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-6f8c862d elementor-widget elementor-widget-image" data-id="6f8c862d" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="image.default">
<img width="800" height="96" src="/images/wp-content_uploads_2025_10_SAP_SuccessF_R_grad_wht-4-1024x123.png" class="attachment-large size-large wp-image-1491" alt="SAP SuccessFactors" decoding="async" srcset="/images/wp-content_uploads_2025_10_SAP_SuccessF_R_grad_wht-4-1024x123.png 1024w, /images/wp-content_uploads_2025_10_SAP_SuccessF_R_grad_wht-4-300x36.png 300w, /images/wp-content_uploads_2025_10_SAP_SuccessF_R_grad_wht-4-768x92.png 768w, /images/wp-content_uploads_2025_10_SAP_SuccessF_R_grad_wht-4-1536x185.png 1536w, /images/wp-content_uploads_2025_10_SAP_SuccessF_R_grad_wht-4-2048x246.png 2048w" sizes="(max-width: 800px) 100vw, 800px" />															</div>
