</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-113ec6aa e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent" data-id="113ec6aa" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container" data-settings="{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}">
<div class="e-con-inner">
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-1770eb93 elementor-widget__width-initial elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading" data-id="1770eb93" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="heading.default">
<h2 class="elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default">Funcionalidades clave de SAP Nómina</h2>				</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-1387af57 elementor-widget__width-initial elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="1387af57" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
<p>SAP Nómina​ te ofrece múltiples funcionalidades para <strong>asegurar un correcto pago de la nómina</strong> entre tu equipo de trabajo. Herramientas clave de SuccessFactors Payroll:</p>								</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-45f46e2f e-grid e-con-boxed e-con e-parent" data-id="45f46e2f" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container" data-settings="{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}">
<div class="e-con-inner">
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-15c0d030 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child" data-id="15c0d030" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container" data-settings="{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}">
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-769312dd elementor-widget elementor-widget-image" data-id="769312dd" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="image.default">
<img loading="lazy" loading="lazy" width="600" height="600" src="/images/wp-content_uploads_2026_02_8-1.webp" class="attachment-large size-large wp-image-2211" alt="" decoding="async" srcset="/images/wp-content_uploads_2026_02_8-1.webp 600w, /images/wp-content_uploads_2026_02_8-1-300x300.webp 300w, /images/wp-content_uploads_2026_02_8-1-150x150.webp 150w" sizes="(max-width: 600px) 100vw, 600px" />															</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-3aaaec elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading" data-id="3aaaec" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="heading.default">
<p class="elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default">Procesamiento de nómina global</p>				</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-f25767e elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="f25767e" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
<p>El software permite ejecutar <strong>nóminas en más de 40 países</strong> y localizaciones específicas. Cumple con regulaciones fiscales y laborales locales: cálculos de <strong>impuestos, días feriados, zonas horarias</strong> y más.</p>								</div>
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-74c3e25b e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child" data-id="74c3e25b" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container" data-settings="{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}">
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-530780cc elementor-widget elementor-widget-image" data-id="530780cc" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="image.default">
<img loading="lazy" loading="lazy" width="600" height="600" src="/images/wp-content_uploads_2026_02_9-1.webp" class="attachment-large size-large wp-image-2212" alt="" decoding="async" srcset="/images/wp-content_uploads_2026_02_9-1.webp 600w, /images/wp-content_uploads_2026_02_9-1-300x300.webp 300w, /images/wp-content_uploads_2026_02_9-1-150x150.webp 150w" sizes="(max-width: 600px) 100vw, 600px" />															</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-33ee47d7 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading" data-id="33ee47d7" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="heading.default">
<p class="elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default">Nómina continua (Continuous Payroll)</p>				</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-15f4063 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="15f4063" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
<p>Monitorea de forma continua errores de nómina y recibe alertas proactivas a los administradores para <strong>corregir problemas antes del cierre del ciclo.</strong></p>								</div>
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-60bd71da e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child" data-id="60bd71da" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container" data-settings="{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}">
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-6f7f7ed0 elementor-widget elementor-widget-image" data-id="6f7f7ed0" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="image.default">
<img loading="lazy" loading="lazy" width="600" height="600" src="/images/wp-content_uploads_2026_02_10-1.webp" class="attachment-large size-large wp-image-2213" alt="" decoding="async" srcset="/images/wp-content_uploads_2026_02_10-1.webp 600w, /images/wp-content_uploads_2026_02_10-1-300x300.webp 300w, /images/wp-content_uploads_2026_02_10-1-150x150.webp 150w" sizes="(max-width: 600px) 100vw, 600px" />															</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-726de019 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading" data-id="726de019" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="heading.default">
<p class="elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default">Pagos fuera del ciclo (Off-cycle payroll)</p>				</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-532ab8d4 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="532ab8d4" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
<p>Soporta <strong>pagos extraordinarios, ajustes y compensaciones</strong> fuera del calendario regular, incluyendo <strong>pagos retroactivos</strong> y ajustes por empleos concurrentes.</p>								</div>
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-6b59557 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child" data-id="6b59557" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container" data-settings="{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}">
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-5c52dcda elementor-widget elementor-widget-image" data-id="5c52dcda" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="image.default">
<img loading="lazy" loading="lazy" width="600" height="600" src="/images/wp-content_uploads_2026_02_11-1.webp" class="attachment-large size-large wp-image-2214" alt="" decoding="async" srcset="/images/wp-content_uploads_2026_02_11-1.webp 600w, /images/wp-content_uploads_2026_02_11-1-300x300.webp 300w, /images/wp-content_uploads_2026_02_11-1-150x150.webp 150w" sizes="(max-width: 600px) 100vw, 600px" />															</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-4aa0b0b1 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading" data-id="4aa0b0b1" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="heading.default">
<p class="elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default">Autoservicio para empleados y managers</p>				</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-3322fdb6 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="3322fdb6" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
<p>Los empleados pueden actualizar sus datos personales y bancarios, <strong>consultar recibos de nómina, historial de pagos</strong> y realizar solicitudes relacionadas con nómina.</p>								</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
